msgid ""
"Clicking in the <guilabel>Level</guilabel> combo-box and choosing "
"<guilabel>Level 2</guilabel> or using the <guimenu>Level</guimenu> menu "
"brings you to level 2. In that level, the user only hears the sound of the "
"letter and has to type in the letter. If he is wrong, the letter appears to "
"help him."
msgstr ""

