"<emphasis>Desert</emphasis> theme and Slovak language."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:260
#, no-c-format
msgid "The sounds appear in random order."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:260
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Clicking in the <guilabel>Level</guilabel> combo-box or using the "
"<guimenu>Level</guimenu> menu in the menubar and choosing <guilabel>Level 4</"
"guilabel> brings you to level 4. In that level, the user only hears the "
"sound of the syllable and has to type in the letters. This level is quite "
"difficult for a young child."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:270
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration dialog"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:271
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The configuration dialog has two pages: one for <guilabel>Font Settings</"
"guilabel> and one for the <guilabel>Timer</guilabel>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:275
#, no-c-format
msgid "About fonts"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can easily change the font that displays the letters. In some "
"distribution, the default font used from the system is really ugly. In grown-"
"up mode, in the <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> menu, in <guimenuitem>Configure "
"&klettres;...</guimenuitem> you will find a <guilabel>Font Settings</"
"guilabel> page with a font chooser dialog. The new font will be applied to "
"both the displayed letter/syllable and the user field."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:282
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Changing font is also nice as some fonts (Helvetica for example) do not "
"display correctly East-European languages as Czech and Slovak. If some "
"letters or syllables are not displayed, please change the font and choose "
"Arial for example."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:287
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also choose here the size you like the best. This size will be kept "
"in configuration."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
