#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:330
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting a new language"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:331
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You might want to use KLettres to help you learn a new language. By using "
"<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Get Alphabet in New Language...</"
"guimenuitem>, you will see a new dialog with the list of available languages "
"(you need to be connected to the Internet to use that feature)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:334
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Get a New Language Dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:340
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Get a New Language Dialog</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:344
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on the <guilabel>Install</guilabel> button on the left of the language "
"you want to install. You'll see the progress bar indicating how the download "
"is progressing. The next screenshot shows Brazilian Portuguese being "
"downloaded."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:345
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please note that some files have several MB so it might be slow depending on "
"your connection."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:346
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After the file is downloaded, it is automatically installed and when you "
"close the <guilabel>Get Hot New Stuff</guilabel> dialog you'll see the new "
"language in the <guimenu>Languages</guimenu> menu and you can use it "
"immediately."
msgstr ""

